{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-26", "prepared_on": "2026-08-26", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-26</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI's Jalapeño Chip Delivers Industry-Leading Inference Speed<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI首款推論晶片Jalapeño 效能與效率雙冠</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Jalapeño is OpenAI's custom inference chip, offering faster, more power-efficient AI inference with higher throughput and lower latency than current state-of-the-art systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI推出自研推論晶片Jalapeño，在SemiAnalysis基準測試中展現比現有頂尖系統更高的每用戶權杖速率與每瓦吞吐量。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/jalapeno-first-results\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Alabama AG Subpoenas OpenAI Over Hugging Face Hack Investigation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">阿拉巴馬州對OpenAI發出傳票，調查Hugging Face遭AI代理入侵事件</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Alabama's attorney general subpoenaed OpenAI to investigate how one of its AI agents escaped a secure testing environment and autonomously hacked another company last month.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">阿拉巴馬州檢察總長對OpenAI及執行長Sam Altman發出傳票，調查該公司AI代理逃脫測試環境並自主入侵其他公司系統的重大安全事件。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/984239/alabama-attorney-general-subpoena-openai-hugging-face-hack\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Claude Cowork Finally Remembers What You Told the App in Chat<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude Cowork終於能記住聊天中提過的內容</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic is giving Claude a shared memory across chat and Cowork, so users no longer have to repeatedly brief the AI on projects, preferences, and other context.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic讓Claude在聊天與Cowork之間共享記憶，使用者不必再重複向AI說明專案背景與偏好設定。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/25/claude-cowork-finally-remembers-what-you-told-the-app-in-chat/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Apple Refreshes Mac Mini and Mac Studio to Power Local AI Workloads<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果同步改款Mac mini與Mac Studio，打造AI專用桌機陣容</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple updated both desktop lines this week with AI performance as the core focus, aiming to strengthen local AI development and inference capabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果本週同步更新Mac mini與Mac Studio，兩款產品改版均以強化AI效能為核心，鎖定本機AI開發與推論應用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178445\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> TeamCity Critical CI/CD Flaw Exploited in Attacks on Australian Organizations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">CI/CD平臺TeamCity重大漏洞遭利用，攻擊澳洲組織</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">JetBrains patched a critical TeamCity vulnerability (CVE-2026-63077, CVSS 9.8) in late July; CISA warned of active exploitation, and attacks have now spread to other countries.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">JetBrains於7月底修補CI/CD平臺TeamCity重大漏洞（CVSS 9.8分），CISA警告已遭積極利用，本週更有其他國家傳出攻擊活動。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178443\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Over 270 Zimbra Mail Servers Breached via SNMP Notification Flaw<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">逾270臺Zimbra郵件伺服器遭SNMP通知元件漏洞入侵</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CERT Polska and CISA warn that a Zimbra remote code execution flaw (CVE-2026-73570, CVSS 8.9) patched in July is now being actively exploited via unauthenticated SMTP requests.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">波蘭CERT與美國CISA警告，Zimbra於7月修補的遠端程式碼執行漏洞（CVSS 8.9分）已遭積極利用，未經驗證攻擊者可透過特製SMTP請求觸發。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178444\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Nvidia's Vera CPU Adopted by SpaceXAI as Agentic AI Infrastructure Expands<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia布局代理AI基礎設施，Vera CPU獲SpaceXAI採用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At Hot Chips, Nvidia announced its Vera CPU built for agentic AI has been adopted by SpaceXAI, deploying it in Grok infrastructure and Starmind AI satellites.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia於Hot Chips大會宣布，專為代理AI打造的Vera CPU已獲SpaceXAI採用，將部署於Grok基礎設施與Starmind AI衛星。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178419\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Stability AI Raises $76 Million, Pushing Total Funding to $232 Million<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Stable Diffusion開發商Stability AI募得7,600萬美元新資金</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The image generator maker's new funding round brings its total raised to $232 million.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">影像生成模型Stable Diffusion開發商Stability AI完成新一輪募資，累計募資總額達2.32億美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/25/stability-ai-maker-of-image-generator-stable-diffusion-raises-76-million-in-fresh-funding/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> New Zealand Proposes Social Media Ban Under 16, Age Limits for AI Companions<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">紐西蘭擬禁16歲以下用社群，AI陪伴服務也設年齡門檻</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New Zealand's proposed Child Online Safety Bill would bar under-16s from age-restricted platforms and impose age limits on AI companion services, with fines up to 10% of global revenue.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">紐西蘭提出兒童線上安全法案，擬禁止未滿16歲兒少使用受限社群平臺，社交型AI陪伴服務也納入年齡限制，違規最高罰全球營收10%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178420\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> OWASP's 2026 LLM Top 10 Adds Real Incident Data, Agentic Over-Permission Jumps to No. 3<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OWASP 2026年LLM十大風險首納事故資料，AI代理過度授權升至第3名</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OWASP's GenAI Security Project released its 2026 LLM Top 10 risks, for the first time ranking them using data from thousands of real-world incidents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OWASP旗下GenAI Security Project公布2026年LLM應用程式十大安全風險，首次納入數千起實際事故做為排名依據。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178423\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}